\cf0 Rescue during the show\'92s distraction
\f2\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Alexander and the audience invest in a ritual whose intended victim is being removed. The reader may know before Alexander, or discover it with him.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Account economically for Eloise\'92s position and camera visibility. Her absence must end his control, not merely invite recapture.\cell \row

