\f1\b \cf0 Eloise redirects someone\'92s loyalty
\f2\b0 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 She contributes to her survival through knowledge of people, money or obligations.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Avoid making her earlier capture meaningless by giving her an effortless means she could have used at any time.\cell \row

